# Normalize line endings so the same bytes work on every platform.
#
# Without this, a Windows checkout turns Bash shebangs into CRLF and the
# scripts break, while the CI matrix runs those same scripts on Linux and
# macOS. PowerShell is the exception: CRLF is its native form, so it is
# stored as LF in the repository and checked out as CRLF.
#
# See AGENTS.md section 9, gotcha 6.

*.sh text eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.py text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
